  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Concept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/36648f6d9fd5d1d56959b630c72b514ab488f27d2525de3370bb428cc41cf8e9.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n20% of 80 + 2x = 45% of 30 + 20% of 85\n\n⇒ 80 × 0.2 + 2x = 30 × 0.45 + 85 × 0.2\n\n⇒ 16 + 2x = 13.5 + 17\n\n⇒ 2x = 13.5 + 17 - 16\n\n⇒ 2x = 14.5\n\n⇒ x = 7.25\n\n⇒ x = 7(1)/(4)\n\n∴ The value of x is 7(1)/(4).",
